msgstr "設定已儲存。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:132
#: src/Plugin.php:73
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:138
msgid "Support messages"
msgstr "客服訊息"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:154
msgid "The WordPress 7.0 AI Client was found"
msgstr "已偵測到 WordPress 7.0 AI Client"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:155
msgid "The WordPress 7.0 AI Client was not found"
msgstr "未偵測到 WordPress 7.0 AI Client"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:158
msgid "About Moksa AI"
msgstr "關於 Moksa AI"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:160
msgid "The admin AI assistant and the automatic replies on the storefront both need the AI Client built into <strong>WordPress 7.0</strong>. Upgrade to 7.0, then add an OpenAI, Anthropic or Google key under Settings → Connectors. Usage is billed to your own key. Order lookup and messaging on the storefront work without a key."
msgstr "後台 AI 助手與前台 AI 自動回覆需要 <strong>WordPress 7.0</strong> 內建的 AI Client:請先升級到 7.0,並到「設定 → Connectors」設定 OpenAI / Anthropic / Google 任一把金鑰(用量計費走你自己的金鑰)。前台客服的「自助查單 / 留言」不需金鑰即可使用。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:169
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "儲存設定"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:180
msgid "Connecting over MCP"
msgstr "如何用 MCP 連線"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:181
msgid "External AI tools such as mcp-remote, Claude and other standard MCP clients can connect straight to the endpoint below. No bridge is needed, and the endpoint is stateless so there is no session to manage:"
msgstr "外部 AI 工具(mcp-remote / Claude 等標準 MCP 客戶端)可直接連到以下端點,不需橋接器(本端點為 stateless,免 session）:"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:184
msgid "Use an account that can edit orders — ideally a <strong>dedicated, limited account rather than an administrator</strong> — and create a password under Users → Profile → Application Passwords."
msgstr "用一個有「編輯訂單」權限的帳號(建議<strong>專用受限帳號,不要用管理員</strong>),到「使用者 → 個人資料 → 應用程式密碼」建立一組密碼。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:185
msgid "Base64-encode “username:application password” with the spaces removed, and send it as an <code>Authorization: Basic &lt;base64&gt;</code> header."
msgstr "把「帳號:應用程式密碼(去掉空格)」做 Base64,當成 <code>Authorization: Basic &lt;base64&gt;</code> 標頭。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:186
msgid "Enter that endpoint and header in the MCP client and the tools will be listed."
msgstr "在 MCP 客戶端填入上面端點 + 該認證標頭,即可列出工具。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:188
msgid "Only <strong>read-only</strong> tools are exposed by default: order lookups, reports and a settings summary. To let an external AI change orders or issue invoices, turn on “Allow external AI to make changes” above — and every change still has to be confirmed in the admin."
msgstr "預設只開放<strong>唯讀</strong>工具(查訂單 / 報表 / 設定彙整);要讓外部 AI 能改訂單 / 開發票,需另外開啟上方「允許外部 AI 執行變更動作」,且變更仍需在後台確認。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:198
msgid "Admin AI assistant"
msgstr "後台 AI 助手"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:200
msgid "A floating chat window in the bottom-right of the admin, where one sentence gets you an order, a count or a status. Requires WordPress 7.0."
msgstr "後台右下角的浮動對話窗,用一句話查訂單 / 數量 / 狀態(需 WordPress 7.0)。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:204
msgid "Enable the admin AI assistant"
msgstr "啟用後台 AI 助手"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:208
msgid "Show the Moksa AI chat window in the admin."
msgstr "在後台顯示 Moksa AI 浮動對話窗。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:211
msgid "Greeting"
msgstr "問候語"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:215
#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Module.php:101
msgid "Hi, I'm Moksa AI. Ask me things like how many orders are awaiting shipment, or look up an invoice or tracking number."
msgstr "嗨,我是 Moksa AI。可以問我:待出貨幾筆?或:查發票號 / 物流單號。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:216
msgid "The first thing shown when the chat window opens."
msgstr "開啟對話窗時的第一句招呼。"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:219
msgid "Example questions"
msgstr "範例問題"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:223
#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Module.php:94
msgid "How many orders are awaiting shipment?,Order counts by status"
msgstr "待出貨有幾筆?,各狀態訂單數量"

#: src/Modules/AiAssistant/Admin/Hub.php:224
