#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:75
msgid "Up to 5 letters or digits. If several stores share one ECPay invoicing account, a prefix keeps their invoice numbers apart."
msgstr "最多 5 字元（限英數字）。同一個綠界發票帳號跨多店時，用前綴避免發票號撞號。"

#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:86
