msgstr "訂單完成（出貨後）才開立"

#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:88
msgid "Only manually, using the button on the order screen"
msgstr "只手動開立（後台按鈕觸發）"

#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:93
msgid "Delay before issuing (days)"
msgstr "延後開立天數"

#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:97
msgid "How many days to wait after the issuing condition is met. The default of 0 issues right away. A common setup is to wait a few days after the order completes, so cancellations and refunds do not need voiding."
msgstr "達到「何時開立」條件後再延幾天才實際開立。預設 0 = 立即。常見：訂單完成後 N 天才開（避免取消退款）。"

#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:110
#: src/Modules/EzpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:54
#: src/Modules/PaynowInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:54
#: src/Modules/SmilepayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:61
