msgstr "手動 — 商家自己進訂單編輯頁按「作廢發票」"

#: src/Modules/EcpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:113
#: src/Modules/EzpayInvoice/Settings/SettingsTab.php:57
msgid "Set this to automatic and the invoice is voided whenever the order is cancelled, refunded or fails, so a forgotten void never turns into a tax problem."
