#: src/Modules/NewebpayShipping/Settings/SettingsTab.php:164
#: src/Modules/SmilepayShipping/Settings/SettingsTab.php:119
msgid "Turn this on when investigating a problem shipment. The log lives under WooCommerce → Status → Logs."
msgstr "排查物流單異常時開啟。位置：WooCommerce → 狀態 → 日誌。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:30
msgid "Taiwan payment, shipping and e-invoice abilities"
msgstr "台灣金流 / 物流 / 電子發票能力"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:42
msgid "Find an order by number"
msgstr "依號碼查訂單"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:43
msgid "Look up matching WooCommerce orders by e-invoice number, tracking number or payment transaction ID, and return the order number, customer, status and admin link. Pass an order number (such as 2855) to check that order directly. Read-only."
msgstr "用電子發票號碼 / 物流單號 / 金流交易序號查詢符合的 WooCommerce 訂單，回傳訂單編號、買家、狀態與後台連結。直接給訂單編號（如 2855）即可查該訂單狀態。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:50
msgid "The order number to look up, or an invoice, shipping or payment number"
msgstr "要查的訂單編號，或發票 / 物流 / 金流號碼"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:99
msgid "Get order details"
msgstr "查訂單明細"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:100
msgid "Get the full details of a single order: status, customer, items, totals, payment method, shipping method, pickup store, plus the e-invoice number and whether it has been issued, the tracking number and the payment transaction ID. Use it to answer questions such as “has the invoice been issued”, “what is the tracking number” or “which store is it going to”. Accepts an order number or any of those numbers. Read-only."
msgstr "取單筆訂單的完整明細：狀態、買家、品項、金額、付款方式、配送方式、取貨門市，以及電子發票號碼（含是否已開立）、物流單號、金流交易序號。用來回答「這筆發票開了嗎 / 物流單號多少 / 取哪間門市」。可給訂單編號或任一號碼。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:107
msgid "An order number, or an invoice, shipping or payment number"
msgstr "訂單編號，或發票 / 物流 / 金流號碼"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:149
msgid "Count orders by status"
msgstr "查訂單數量 / 狀態"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:150
msgid "Return order counts: either the number of orders in every status, or the count for one status. Common status slugs: processing, pending, on-hold, completed, cancelled, refunded. Use all (or omit status) to get the breakdown across every status. For an actual list of orders use list-orders instead; to find one customer's orders use find-customer-orders. Read-only."
msgstr "查訂單「數量 / 統計」:回各狀態筆數分布,或某狀態的訂單筆數。常見狀態 slug:processing(處理中 / 待出貨)、pending(待付款)、on-hold(保留中)、completed(已完成)、cancelled(已取消)、refunded(已退款)。status 用 all(或省略)回各狀態分布。要實際訂單清單請改用 list-orders;查某顧客的訂單用 find-customer-orders。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:157
msgid "A WooCommerce order status slug. Use all for the breakdown across every status, or name one such as processing, pending, completed, cancelled or refunded"
msgstr "WooCommerce 訂單狀態 slug;用 all 取得各狀態筆數分布,或指定如 processing(處理中 / 待出貨)、pending(待付款)、completed(已完成)、cancelled(已取消)、refunded(已退款)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:193
msgid "Change order status"
msgstr "更改訂單狀態"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:194
msgid "Move an order to a new status such as processing, completed or cancelled. This is a destructive action — calling the tool only proposes the change, and nothing happens until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "把指定訂單改成新的狀態(如 processing 處理中、completed 已完成、cancelled 已取消)。這是破壞性操作 —— 呼叫此工具只會「提出」變更,系統會要求使用者按「確認執行」後才真正變更,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:201
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1074
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1247
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1287
msgid "The order number, for example 2896"
msgstr "訂單編號(如 2896)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:205
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1338
msgid "The target status slug, such as processing, completed, cancelled, on-hold or refunded"
msgstr "目標狀態 slug,如 processing / completed / cancelled / on-hold / refunded"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:255
msgid "Create shipments in bulk"
msgstr "批次建立託運單"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:256
msgid "Create shipments for several orders at once and get their tracking numbers, choosing the carrier automatically from each order's shipping method. This is destructive and cannot be undone — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is created until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "一次為「多筆」訂單建立託運單並取得物流單號(依各訂單運送方式自動判斷物流商)。破壞性、不可逆 —— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才建單,你不需要自己再追問。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:264
msgid "An array of order numbers, for example [\"2867\",\"2664\"]"
msgstr "訂單編號陣列(如 [\"2867\",\"2664\"])"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:296
msgid "Find a customer's orders"
msgstr "查顧客訂單"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:297
msgid "Look up every order belonging to a customer by email address, phone number or name, and return the list along with the total amount paid. Read-only."
msgstr "用顧客的 email、電話或姓名查他的所有訂單(回傳訂單清單與已付款累計)。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:304
msgid "The customer's email address, phone number or name"
msgstr "顧客 email / 電話 / 姓名"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:336
msgid "Revenue and order statistics"
msgstr "營收訂單統計"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:337
msgid "Order count, paid revenue, status breakdown and average order value for a period. The period is optional and defaults to this_month: today, yesterday, this_month, last_month, this_year or custom. With custom, also pass date_from and date_to in YYYY-MM-DD format. Read-only."
msgstr "某期間的訂單數、已付款營收、各狀態分布、平均客單價。period 選填(預設本月 this_month):today / yesterday / this_month / last_month / this_year / custom(custom 時再給 date_from、date_to,格式 YYYY-MM-DD)。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:346
msgid "The period. Optional, defaults to this_month. One of today, yesterday, this_month, last_month, this_year or custom"
msgstr "期間(選填,預設 this_month)。今天=today、昨天=yesterday、本月=this_month、上個月=last_month、今年=this_year、自訂區間=custom"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:350
msgid "Start date in YYYY-MM-DD format, used with the custom period"
msgstr "custom 時的起始日期 YYYY-MM-DD"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:354
msgid "End date in YYYY-MM-DD format, used with the custom period"
msgstr "custom 時的結束日期 YYYY-MM-DD"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:391
msgid "List shipping zones and methods"
msgstr "列出運送區域與方式"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:392
msgid "List every shipping method in the WooCommerce shipping zones, such as 7-ELEVEN pickup or T-Cat ambient and frozen delivery, along with whether each is enabled. Use it to confirm a method name before switching it. No parameters. Read-only."
msgstr "列出 WooCommerce 運送區域內所有運送方式(7-11 取貨 / 黑貓常溫冷凍 等)與啟用狀態。切換前先用這個確認方式名稱。免參數。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:400
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:531
msgid "Optional, can be omitted"
msgstr "選填,可省略"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:432
msgid "Enable or disable a shipping method"
msgstr "啟用/停用運送方式"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:433
msgid "Enable or disable one shipping method in a WooCommerce shipping zone, for example “SmilePay T-Cat ambient” or “ECPay 7-ELEVEN pickup”. Pass the method name directly. This is a destructive action because it changes what customers can choose at checkout — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing takes effect until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "啟用或停用 WooCommerce 運送區域內的某個運送方式(如「速買配 黑貓常溫」「綠界 7-11 取貨」)。method 直接給方式名稱即可。這是破壞性操作(影響前台結帳可選的運送方式)—— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才生效,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:440
msgid "The shipping method name, for example SmilePay T-Cat ambient"
msgstr "運送方式名稱(如 速買配 黑貓常溫)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:444
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:704
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:795
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:988
msgid "true to enable, false to disable"
msgstr "true=啟用、false=停用"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:478
msgid "Check payment status"
msgstr "查付款狀態"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:479
msgid "Check the payment status of an order: payment method, whether it is paid, transaction ID, last four card digits, ATM virtual account and convenience store payment code. NewebPay orders are also queried live against NewebPay. Read-only."
msgstr "查某訂單的付款狀態:付款方式、是否已付款、交易序號、卡末四、ATM 虛擬帳號、超商繳費代碼。藍新金流訂單會額外向藍新做即時查詢(B02)。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:522
msgid "Summarize plugin settings"
msgstr "彙整外掛設定"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:523
msgid "Summarize the current non-sensitive settings: which payment, shipping and e-invoice channels are enabled, whether each module is in test or production mode, when invoices are issued, which fields order number lookup searches, and whether the AI assistant is on. No credentials are included. No parameters. Read-only."
msgstr "彙整目前非敏感設定:哪些金流/物流/發票管道啟用、各模組測試或正式模式、發票開立時機、訂單查號可搜尋欄位、AI 助手是否啟用。不含任何憑證。免參數。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:565
msgid "Resend the payment details email"
msgstr "重寄付款資訊信"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:566
msgid "Resend the payment details email, such as the ATM virtual account or convenience store payment code, to the customer. Only orders that have those details can be sent; card orders have none. This is a destructive action because it emails the customer — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is sent until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "重寄付款資訊信(ATM 虛擬帳號 / 超商繳費代碼等)給訂單的顧客。只有有這類付款資訊的訂單可寄(信用卡訂單沒有)。這是破壞性操作(會寄信給顧客)—— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才寄出,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:605
msgid "Get tracking links"
msgstr "取貨態追蹤連結"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:606
msgid "Get the shipment tracking links for an order: each carrier's public tracking page plus the tracking number. Read-only."
msgstr "取某訂單的物流貨態追蹤連結(各家物流的公開查詢頁 + 物流單號)。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:647
msgid "List invoice issuing options"
msgstr "列出發票開立方式"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:648
msgid "List the issuing options an e-invoice service (ECPay, ezPay, SmilePay, PayNow or Amego) supports — member carrier, mobile barcode, Citizen Digital Certificate, paper, donation and tax ID — along with whether each is enabled. Read-only."
msgstr "列出某家電子發票(綠界/ezPay/速買配/PayNow/Amego)支援的開立方式(會員載具/手機條碼/自然人憑證/紙本/捐贈/統編)與啟用狀態。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:655
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:695
msgid "The e-invoice module name or slug, for example ECPay or ecpay"
msgstr "發票模組名稱或 slug(如 綠界 / ecpay)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:687
msgid "Enable or disable invoice issuing options"
msgstr "啟用/停用發票開立方式"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:688
msgid "Enable or disable one or more issuing options for an e-invoice service: member carrier, mobile barcode, Citizen Digital Certificate, paper, donation or tax ID. Pass the option names directly. This is a destructive action — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing takes effect until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "啟用或停用某家電子發票的一或多種開立方式(會員載具、手機條碼、自然人憑證、紙本、捐贈、統編)。channels 直接給名稱即可。這是破壞性操作 —— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才生效,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:700
msgid "An array of issuing option names, for example [\"Mobile barcode\",\"Donation\"]"
msgstr "開立方式名稱陣列(如 [\"手機條碼\",\"捐贈\"])"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:738
msgid "List payment methods"
msgstr "列出金流付款方式"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:739
msgid "List every individual payment method offered by a payment service (ECPay, NewebPay, PAYUNi, SmilePay, PayNow or PChomePay) and whether each is enabled. Use it to confirm what is available before switching anything. Read-only."
msgstr "列出某個金流(綠界/藍新/PAYUNi/速買配/PayNow/PChomePay)所有「個別付款方式」與啟用狀態。切換前先用這個確認有哪些方式。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:746
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:786
msgid "The payment service name or slug, for example ECPay or ecpay"
msgstr "金流名稱或 slug(如 綠界 / ecpay)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:778
msgid "Enable or disable payment methods"
msgstr "啟用/停用金流付款方式"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:779
msgid "Enable or disable one or more individual payment methods within a payment service, such as ECPay's one-off credit card payment, Apple Pay or ATM. Pass the method names directly. This is a destructive action — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing takes effect until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "啟用或停用某個金流裡的一或多個「個別付款方式」(如綠界的信用卡一次付清、Apple Pay、ATM)。methods 直接給方式名稱即可。這是破壞性操作 —— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才生效,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:791
msgid "An array of payment method names, for example [\"Credit card, pay in full\",\"Apple Pay\"]"
msgstr "付款方式名稱陣列(如 [\"信用卡一次付清\",\"Apple Pay\"])"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:829
msgid "Issue an invoice allowance"
msgstr "開立發票折讓單"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:830
msgid "Issue an allowance against an order's existing e-invoice, used for partial refunds. An amount is required. Only ECPay, ezPay and Amego support this. It is destructive and cannot be undone — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is issued until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "為訂單已開立的電子發票開立折讓單(部分退款用),需指定折讓金額。僅綠界/ezPay/Amego 支援。破壞性、不可逆 —— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才開立,你不需要自己再追問。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:841
msgid "The allowance amount as a whole number, which cannot exceed the order total"
msgstr "折讓金額(整數,不可超過訂單金額)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:873
msgid "Advanced order list"
msgstr "進階訂單列表"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:874
msgid "Return an actual list of orders, filtered by status, date range (date_from and date_to in YYYY-MM-DD format) and payment method. The list is compact and returns 20 orders by default, up to a maximum of 50. If you only need counts per status, use query-orders instead. Read-only."
msgstr "回傳「實際訂單清單」:依狀態、日期區間(date_from / date_to,YYYY-MM-DD)、金流方式篩選,回精簡清單(預設 20 筆、上限 50)。只要各狀態的筆數 / 數量請改用 query-orders。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:881
msgid "An order status slug such as processing or completed. Omit it for every status"
msgstr "訂單狀態 slug(如 processing / completed),不給則全部"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:885
msgid "Start date in YYYY-MM-DD format"
msgstr "起始日期 YYYY-MM-DD"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:889
msgid "End date in YYYY-MM-DD format"
msgstr "結束日期 YYYY-MM-DD"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:893
msgid "Payment method ID (optional)"
msgstr "金流方式 id(選填)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:897
msgid "How many orders to return. Defaults to 20, maximum 50"
msgstr "最多幾筆(預設 20,上限 50)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:934
msgid "List payment, shipping and e-invoice channels"
msgstr "列出金流/物流/發票管道"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:935
msgid "List the payment, shipping and e-invoice channels with their slugs and whether each is enabled. Use all for everything, or filter with payment, shipping or invoice. Read-only."
msgstr "列出金流、物流、電子發票管道與其啟用狀態(含 slug)。category 用 all 取全部,或 payment / shipping / invoice 篩選。唯讀。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:944
msgid "Optional, defaults to all. Or filter with payment, shipping or invoice"
msgstr "選填,預設 all(全部);或 payment / shipping / invoice 篩選"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:976
msgid "Enable or disable a channel"
msgstr "啟用/停用管道"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:977
msgid "Enable or disable a payment, shipping or e-invoice channel. Pass the channel name (such as “SmilePay shipping”) or its slug directly; there is no need to list them first. This is a destructive action, because disabling a channel changes what customers can choose at checkout and enabling one without credentials causes errors on the storefront — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing takes effect until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself. It does not touch credentials or the test and production switch."
msgstr "啟用或停用某個金流/物流/電子發票管道。channel 可直接給管道名稱(如「速買配物流」)或 slug,不必先查清單。這是破壞性操作(停用會影響結帳可用方式、啟用未設定憑證的管道會在前台出錯)—— 呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才生效,你不需要自己再追問。不處理憑證與測試/正式切換。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:984
msgid "The channel name or slug, for example “SmilePay shipping” or smilepay_shipping"
msgstr "管道名稱或 slug(如「速買配物流」或 smilepay_shipping)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1020
msgid "Add an invoice donation charity"
msgstr "新增發票捐贈單位"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1021
msgid "Add a charity, with its name and love code, to the donation list of the enabled e-invoice module so customers can choose it at checkout. A love code is 3 to 7 digits. Calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is saved until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "新增一個電子發票捐贈單位(社福團體名稱 + 愛心碼)到啟用中發票模組的捐贈名單,之後結帳的捐贈選單就能選。愛心碼為 3-7 碼數字。呼叫只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才寫入,你不需要自己再追問。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1028
msgid "The name of the charity"
msgstr "捐贈單位 / 社福團體名稱"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1032
msgid "The love code, 3 to 7 digits"
msgstr "愛心碼(3-7 碼數字)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1066
msgid "Create a shipment"
msgstr "建立託運單"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1067
msgid "Create a shipment with the carrier for an order and get its tracking number, choosing the carrier automatically from the order's shipping method. This is destructive and cannot be undone, because it places a real booking with the carrier — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is created until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself. A label can only be printed once the shipment exists."
msgstr "為訂單向物流商建立託運單並取得物流單號(依訂單的運送方式自動判斷物流商)。這是破壞性、不可逆的操作(會向物流商真實下單)—— 呼叫此工具只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後才真正建單,你不需要自己再追問確認。建單後才能列印物流單。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1108
msgid "Add an order note"
msgstr "新增訂單備註"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1109
msgid "Add an internal note to an order. It is for your own records and is not sent to the customer."
msgstr "為指定訂單加一則內部備註(記事用,不寄給客戶)。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1120
msgid "The note"
msgstr "備註內容"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1177
msgid "The note cannot be empty."
msgstr "備註內容不可空白。"

#. translators: %s: order number
#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1184
#, php-format
msgid "A note was added to order #%s."
msgstr "已為訂單 #%s 加上備註。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1192
msgid "Print shipping labels"
msgstr "列印物流單"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1193
msgid "Print shipping labels for one or more orders, grouped automatically by carrier. Calling the tool only proposes it; the print page opens once the user presses Confirm. An order needs an existing shipment before it has a label to print."
msgstr "為一筆或多筆訂單列印物流標籤(託運單)。自動依各訂單的物流商分組。呼叫此工具只會「提出」,使用者按「確認執行」後會開啟列印頁。訂單需已建立託運單才有標籤可印。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1201
msgid "An array of order numbers to print, for example [\"2867\",\"2664\"]"
msgstr "要列印的訂單編號陣列(如 [\"2867\",\"2664\"])"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1205
msgid "Paper: 1 for A4 (the default) or 2 for an A6 label printer"
msgstr "紙張:1=A4(預設)、2=A6 標籤機"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1239
msgid "Issue an e-invoice"
msgstr "開立電子發票"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1240
msgid "Issue an e-invoice for an order, using the invoice service and invoice type already set on it. This is a destructive tax operation that cannot be undone — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is issued until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "為指定訂單開立電子發票(自動依訂單設定的發票商與發票類型)。這是破壞性、不可逆的稅務操作 —— 呼叫此工具只會「提出」,系統會要求使用者按「確認執行」後才真正開立,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1279
msgid "Void an e-invoice"
msgstr "作廢電子發票"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1280
msgid "Void the e-invoice already issued for an order. A reason is required. This is a destructive tax operation that cannot be undone — calling the tool only proposes it, and nothing is voided until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
msgstr "作廢指定訂單已開立的電子發票,需提供作廢原因。這是破壞性、不可逆的稅務操作 —— 呼叫此工具只會「提出」,系統會要求使用者按「確認執行」後才真正作廢,你不需要自己再追問確認。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1291
msgid "The reason for voiding, for example a customer cancellation or an issuing mistake"
msgstr "作廢原因(如:客戶取消、開立錯誤)"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1325
msgid "Change order status in bulk"
msgstr "批次更改訂單狀態"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1326
msgid "Move several orders to the same new status at once, such as processing, completed or cancelled. This is a destructive action — calling the tool only proposes the change, and nothing happens until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself. Use this whenever the user mentions two or more orders together."
msgstr "把「多筆」訂單一次改成同一個新狀態(如 processing 處理中、completed 已完成、cancelled 已取消)。這是破壞性操作 —— 呼叫此工具只會「提出」變更,系統會要求使用者按「確認執行」後才真正變更,你不需要自己再追問確認。只要使用者一次提到兩筆以上訂單就用這個。"

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1334
msgid "An array of order numbers to change, for example [\"2896\",\"2897\",\"2900\"]"
msgstr "要變更的訂單編號陣列(如 [\"2896\",\"2897\",\"2900\"])"

