#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:92
msgid "Calculate shipping per temperature zone (advanced)"
msgstr "依溫層分別計算運費（進階）"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:94
msgid "On multi-zone orders, each shipment carries the shipping cost of its own temperature zone"
msgstr "多溫層訂單，每個溫層的物流單帶該溫層自己的運費"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:96
msgid "Off by default: the cost formula is evaluated once for the whole cart and the entire shipping cost goes onto the first shipment, so with cash on delivery the first parcel collects all of it. When on, the cost formula is evaluated separately for the items in each temperature zone. The cost the customer sees at checkout is the sum of every zone, so a multi-zone order pays the base rate more than once, and each shipment carries the amount worked out for its own zone. You also need a cost formula such as `[moksafowo_addfee cool_2=\"X\" cool_3=\"Y\"]` for the zones to produce different amounts."
msgstr "預設關閉：cost formula 依整車一次性算出單一運費，整單運費全數塞給第一張物流單（COD 第一張代收所有運費）。開啟後：cost formula 會對每個溫層的商品「分別」評估一次，顧客結帳顯示的運費 = 各溫層運費總和（多溫層 = 多份基本費），每張物流單的 GoodsAmount / COD 代收金額會帶該溫層自己評估出來的運費。需搭配 `[moksafowo_addfee cool_2=\"X\" cool_3=\"Y\"]` 的 cost formula 才能讓不同溫層算出不同運費。"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:100
msgid "Show the temperature zone breakdown at checkout (advanced)"
msgstr "結帳顯示溫層拆解（進階）"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:102
msgid "On multi-zone orders, show the item count and cost of each temperature zone after the method name"
msgstr "多溫層訂單，物流名稱後面顯示各溫層件數與運費"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:104
msgid "On by default: the shipping options at checkout append a breakdown such as “🟫 Ambient ×1　🟦 Chilled ×2” after the method name. Ambient-only orders and single-zone methods show nothing."
msgstr "預設開啟：結帳頁的物流選項會在物流名稱後面附上「🟫 常溫 ×1　🟦 冷藏 ×2」之類的拆解。純常溫訂單、或單溫層 method 不會顯示。"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:108
msgid "Ambient marker"
msgstr "常溫 marker"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:111
msgid "The symbol shown before the breakdown text — an emoji or any character. Leave blank to use “·”"
msgstr "拆解文字前的視覺符號（emoji 或任意字元）。留空 = 用「·」"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:115
msgid "Chilled marker"
msgstr "冷藏 marker"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:118
#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:125
msgid "The symbol shown before the breakdown text. Leave blank to use “·”"
msgstr "拆解文字前的視覺符號。留空 = 用「·」"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:122
msgid "Frozen marker"
msgstr "冷凍 marker"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:129
msgid "Breakdown separator"
msgstr "拆解分隔符"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:134
msgid "Full-width space (　) — separates visually without wrapping"
msgstr "全形空格（　）— 視覺隔開但不換行"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:135
msgid "Vertical bar (｜) — a clear divider"
msgstr "直線（｜）— 明確分隔"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:136
msgid "Middle dot (·) — compact"
msgstr "點（·）— 簡潔"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:137
msgid "Ideographic comma (、) — natural in Chinese"
msgstr "頓號（、）— 中文閱讀習慣"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:139
msgid "How the temperature zones are separated. Block checkout turns \\n line breaks into spaces, so full-width characters are the safest choice."
msgstr "多溫層之間如何分隔。Block 結帳會把 \\n 換行 normalize 成 space，所以走全形字元最穩。"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:143
msgid "Breakdown detail level"
msgstr "拆解顯示密度"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:148
msgid "Full — 🟫 Ambient ×3　🟦 Chilled ×5　🟪 Frozen ×2"
msgstr "完整 — 🟫 常溫 ×3　🟦 冷藏 ×5　🟪 冷凍 ×2"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:149
msgid "Compact — 🟫×3 🟦×5 🟪×2 (the emoji already carry the color meaning, about 30% shorter)"
msgstr "精簡 — 🟫×3 🟦×5 🟪×2（emoji 已有顏色語意，省 30%）"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:150
msgid "Summary — 🟫🟦🟪 10 items in total (shortest; a multi-zone order shows only the icons)"
msgstr "摘要 — 🟫🟦🟪 共 10 件（最短，多溫層只看到圖示組合）"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:152
msgid "On orders with many items across several zones the full version can be too long and wrap onto two lines at checkout, splitting “Chilled” from “×5”. The compact version drops the labels and relies on the emoji colors, which usually fits on one line. The summary version shows only the zone icons and the total item count, which takes the least space."
msgstr "多 qty + 多溫層訂單，完整版可能在結帳頁因為太長 wrap 被斷成兩行（「冷藏」跟「×5」可能拆到不同行）。精簡版去掉中文 label 用 emoji 顏色辨識，多半能一行顯示。摘要版只顯示溫層 emoji 組合 + 總件數，最節省空間。"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:320
msgid "Accepts a plain number or a formula containing shortcodes. The result is an amount in New Taiwan dollars."
msgstr "支援純數字或含 shortcode 的算式，計算結果為新台幣金額。"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:321
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "範例："

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:322
msgid "<code>100</code> — a flat NT$100"
msgstr "<code>100</code> — 固定 100 元"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:323
msgid "<code>100 + [moksafowo_addfee cool_2=\"50\" cool_3=\"100\"]</code> — NT$100 for ambient, plus 50 if the order contains chilled items and plus 100 if it contains frozen items"
msgstr "<code>100 + [moksafowo_addfee cool_2=\"50\" cool_3=\"100\"]</code> — 常溫 100、含冷藏訂單 +50、含冷凍訂單 +100"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:324
msgid "<code>[moksafowo_addfee temp_1=\"100\" temp_2=\"150\" temp_3=\"200\"]</code> — 100 ambient / 150 chilled / 200 frozen. Tick “Calculate shipping per temperature zone” below and each shipment carries the price of its own zone"
msgstr "<code>[moksafowo_addfee temp_1=\"100\" temp_2=\"150\" temp_3=\"200\"]</code> — 常溫 100 / 冷藏 150 / 冷凍 200（搭配下方「依溫層分別計算運費」勾起來，每張物流單就帶該溫層的價格）"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:325
msgid "<code>50 + [moksafowo_addfee qty=\"10\"]</code> — 50 plus NT$10 per item"
msgstr "<code>50 + [moksafowo_addfee qty=\"10\"]</code> — 50 + 每件 10 元"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:326
msgid "<code>[moksafowo_addfee weight=\"20\"]</code> — NT$20 per kilogram"
msgstr "<code>[moksafowo_addfee weight=\"20\"]</code> — 每公斤 20 元"

#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:327
msgid "Attributes: <code>temp_1</code> = ambient base, <code>temp_2</code> = chilled base, <code>temp_3</code> = frozen base, <code>cool</code> = added when anything needs refrigeration, <code>cool_2</code> = extra for chilled, <code>cool_3</code> = extra for frozen, <code>qty</code> = per item, <code>weight</code> = per kilogram."
msgstr "屬性：<code>temp_1</code>=常溫 base、<code>temp_2</code>=冷藏 base、<code>temp_3</code>=冷凍 base、<code>cool</code>=任一冷的就加、<code>cool_2</code>=冷藏額外加、<code>cool_3</code>=冷凍額外加、<code>qty</code>=每件加、<code>weight</code>=每公斤加。"

