msgstr "測試 Webhook 簽章密鑰"

#: src/Modules/Tappay/Settings/SettingsTab.php:53
msgid "The notification signing key set in the TapPay dashboard, used to verify payment notifications. Leave blank to use the partner key."
msgstr "TapPay 後台設定的通知簽章密鑰，用於驗證付款通知。留空 = 用 Partner Key。"

#: src/Modules/Tappay/Settings/SettingsTab.php:66
