msgid "Overview"
msgstr "總覽"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:256
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "進階設定"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:332
msgid "Shared shipping settings"
msgstr "物流共用設定"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:334
msgid "Behavior settings shared by every shipping module."
msgstr "所有物流模組共用的行為設定。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:338
msgid "Bulk printing interface"
msgstr "批次列印介面"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:342
msgid "Basic — use the built-in WooCommerce bulk actions dropdown: tick the orders, then pick the bulk action."
msgstr "基本 — 走 WooCommerce 內建下拉選單，自己勾訂單再選批次操作。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:350
msgid "Advanced — the “ECPay store / home delivery labels” toolbar button opens a dialog that hides already-printed orders, so you can tick them and print in one go without missing any."
msgstr "進階 — 點工具列「綠界 超商/宅配標籤」按鈕後跳出彈窗，自動過濾未印單，一次勾選一鍵列印（防漏印）。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:361
msgid "Custom order statuses"
msgstr "自訂訂單狀態"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:363
msgid "Custom order statuses shared by the shipping modules. Once disabled they no longer appear on the order edit screen or in the bulk actions menu, but existing orders keep the status they already have."
msgstr "物流模組共用的自訂訂單狀態。停用後不再出現在訂單編輯頁與批次操作選單，但既有訂單仍保留原狀態。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:371
msgid "The carrier has collected the parcel and delivery is under way"
msgstr "物流商已收件並開始配送"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:378
msgid "Arrived at the store and waiting for pickup (convenience store pickup only)"
msgstr "已到店待取（超商取貨流程專用）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:385
msgid "Store closed (the convenience store has closed and another store must be chosen)"
msgstr "門市關轉（超商門市關閉，需重選門市）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:395
msgid "Order status colors"
msgstr "訂單狀態顏色"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:397
msgid "Background and text colors for the status labels in the WordPress order list. Click a swatch to pick a color with the built-in WordPress color picker; the preview on the right updates as you go."
msgstr "WordPress 後台訂單列表狀態標籤的底色與文字顏色。點色塊用 WordPress 內建選色器選色，右邊即時預覽。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:411
msgid "Taiwan address tools"
msgstr "台灣地址工具"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:413
msgid "Taiwan localization for the checkout address fields. Works with both classic and block checkout."
msgstr "結帳頁地址欄位的台灣本地化加強。傳統結帳與區塊結帳都相容。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:417
msgid "Enable Taiwan city and district dropdowns"
msgstr "啟用台灣縣市/鄉鎮下拉選單"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:421
msgid "Turn the city and district address fields into dropdowns so customers cannot mistype them."
msgstr "把地址欄位的「縣 / 市」「鄉 / 鎮 / 區」改成下拉選單，避免顧客手動拼錯。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:427
msgid "Fill in the postcode automatically once the city and district are chosen, using the latest official postcode table"
msgstr "選完縣市鄉鎮後自動帶入郵遞區號（依政府最新郵遞區號表）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:434
msgid "Swap the name fields — change the WooCommerce default “First name / Last name” order to the Taiwanese “Last name / First name”."
msgstr "姓名對調 — 把 WooCommerce 預設「名字 / 姓氏」順序改成台灣慣例「姓氏 / 名字」。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:441
msgid "Hide the “Country / Region” field (for stores that only ship within Taiwan)"
msgstr "隱藏「國家 / 地區」欄位（單一台灣站適用）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:448
msgid "Enable the Taiwanese field order and widths (drag to arrange below) — the order and the 50% / 100% widths apply to both classic and block checkout."
msgstr "啟用台式欄位順序與寬度（下方拖拉設定）— 傳統結帳與區塊結帳都會套用順序與 50% / 100% 寬度。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:459
msgid "Taiwan field order and widths"
msgstr "台灣欄位順序與寬度"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:461
msgid "Drag to reorder the fields and pick a 50% or 100% width. “Enable the Taiwanese field order” above must be ticked for this to reach the checkout page."
msgstr "拖曳重排欄位、選 50% 或 100% 寬度。需勾選上方「啟用台式欄位順序」才會套用到結帳頁。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:465
msgid "Field order and width"
msgstr "欄位順序與寬度"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:467
msgid "Half-width fields sit side by side only in pairs (for example Last name 50% + First name 50% on one row). A 50% field left on its own falls back to 100%. Applies to both classic and block checkout."
msgstr "半寬欄位需兩兩配對才會並排（例：姓氏 50% + 名字 50% → 同一行）。落單的 50% 會自動退回 100%。傳統與區塊結帳皆適用。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:479
msgid "Let the WooCommerce order search box and the Ctrl+K command palette recognize Taiwan-specific numbers. Only numbers from enabled modules are searched."
msgstr "讓 WooCommerce 訂單搜尋框與 Ctrl+K 命令面板認得台灣特有號碼。只搜尋已啟用模組的號碼。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:483
msgid "Enable order number lookup"
msgstr "啟用訂單查號搜尋"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:487
msgid "Once enabled you can look up orders by the numbers below from the order list search box and the command palette."
msgstr "開啟後，可在訂單列表搜尋框與命令面板用下列號碼查訂單。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:490
msgid "Number types to search"
msgstr "搜尋號碼類型"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:545
msgid "Tick the number types to include in the search. The more fields, the slower the search — tick only the ones you actually use."
msgstr "勾選要納入搜尋的號碼類型。欄位越多搜尋越慢，常用的勾起來即可。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:548
msgid "Speed up with an index (recommended for stores with many orders)"
msgstr "加速索引（大量訂單建議開啟）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:552
msgid "Store the searchable numbers in a dedicated index table so lookups stay fast as the store grows. The index is built in the background once enabled."
msgstr "把可搜尋號碼建到專用索引表，訂單量大時查號更快。開啟後會在背景自動建立索引。"

